'''Helix Fossil''' (Japanese: '''かいの化石''' ''Shellfish Fossil'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Play this card as if it were a 40-HP Basic {{e|Colorless}} Pokémon.<br>At any time during your turn, you may discard this card from play.<br>This card can't retreat.
}}

==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to that of the {{TCG|Unidentified Fossil}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but has 40 HP instead of 60 HP and only {{TCG|Omanyte}} can evolve from.
** {{TCG|Helix Fossil}} also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but has 50 HP and also has a {{TCG|Poké-Body}}.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fates Collide|Helix Fossil Omanyte|102}} from the {{TCG|Fates Collide}} expansion.
*[[Helix Fossil]]s are [[fossil]]s in the [[Pokémon games]] which can be revived into {{p|Omanyte}}.

